        {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Sedra",
            "when": "9 months ago",
            "body": "I honestly can't say enough good things about Tamaru Beauty Academy and my amazing trainer, Maggie! From the moment I walked in, I felt welcomed, supported, and truly cared for. Maggie isn't just a trainer — she's a mentor, a cheerleader, and a true inspiration. She teaches with so much passion and patience, and she makes sure every single student understands and feels confident before moving on. Her positive energy and kindness made every class something to look forward to. She always took the time to guide me, encourage me, and push me to believe in myself. Because of her, I've grown so much — not just in my skills, but in my confidence too. Tamaru Beauty Academy has such a warm, friendly atmosphere, and Maggie makes it feel like a family. I'm so grateful for everything I've learned and for the love and support I've received. Thank you, Maggie, for being such a beautiful soul and an incredible trainer. You've truly changed my journey for the better! 💕✨"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Candice",
            "when": "9 months ago",
            "body": "At Tamara Academy, you truly get a one-stop experience for all your beauty courses. From the very first phone call with Maggie, her warm and welcoming voice reassured me that I had found the right place. When I arrived at her studio, the beauty and calming atmosphere instantly took my breath away. Maggie is incredibly kind, easy to talk to, and patiently listens to and answers every question. Because of her in professionalism and genuine care, I decided to complete four courses with her: Lash Extensions, Facials, Makeup, and Nail Technology. Her teachers are also wonderful—supportive, knowledgeable, and friendly. Thank you, Maggie 💖 I am truly grateful for the amazing experience."
