            "name": "Devorah Grinblat",
            "when": "a year ago",
            "body": "I have been a two time student at Tamarua Beauty Academy because I absolutely loved the first course so much! I have done facials, and am currently completing the nail course and am thoroughly enjoying it. The teachers are lovely, skilled and caring and will answer any questions I have. The learning environment is super positive and enjoyable. I found that Tamarua go above and beyond other training institutions as they offer in person training, which is rare to find in this new age online environment. Being able to do in person classes means I can be more hands on and learn with teachers there in person for guidance and to see my work and skill development. I highly recommend this beauty academy to anyone looking to upskill!"
