        {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Mary Monaco",
            "when": "a year ago",
            "body": "I can't say enough amazing things about Tamarua Beauty Academy! From the moment I walked through the doors, I felt welcomed, empowered, and inspired. The educators are not only incredibly knowledgeable and experienced, but they genuinely care about each student's growth and success. The curriculum is top-tier—modern, hands-on, and aligned with current industry trends. Whether you're pursuing a career in hair, makeup, spray tanning, barbering, nails, this academy gives you everything you need to thrive in the beauty industry. The facilities are state-of-the-art, and the real-world training opportunities gave me the confidence to start working with clients even before graduation. What truly sets this academy apart is the supportive, positive environment. It's more than a school—it's a community. I left with lifelong skills, a strong portfolio, and connections that continue to help me in my career. If you're serious about turning your passion into a profession, Tamarua Beauty Academy is the place to be. It changed my life, and I know it can do the same for you!"
